;THIS TIM FROM A HYPERTHERMOPHILIC ORGANISM EXISTS IN VIVO
AS A PGK-TIM FUSION PROTEIN. THE RECOMBINANT SEPARATE
TIM-ENZYME IS ALSO HYPERTHERMOPHILIC. IT IS A TETRAMER. THE
TETRAMER IS FORMED BY APPLYING THE CRYSTALLOGRAPHIC TWOFOLD
AXIS ON THE ASYMETRIC UNIT (A DIMER). THE MAIN INTERDIMERIC
CONTACTS ARE 2 DISULFIDE BONDS.
;
